==Battleground==
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
**2 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Using [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]] like [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sushi Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] to tank and deal damage respectively can take care of this stage pretty easily. Add [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|Meatshields]] and Anti-Red [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|Crowd-Controllers]] if you find yourself struggling.

